{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wasm-micro-runtime/wasm-micro-runtime/compare/main...1f98fb01d09b2ef5e49dc0be2e6006f962fd87f1","html_url":"https://github.com/wasm-micro-runtime/wasm-micro-runtime/compare/main...1f98fb01d09b2ef5e49dc0be2e6006f962fd87f1","permalink_url":"https://github.com/wasm-micro-runtime/wasm-micro-runtime/compare/wasm-micro-runtime:ffc2288...wasm-micro-runtime:1f98fb0","diff_url":"https://github.com/wasm-micro-runtime/wasm-micro-runtime/compare/main...1f98fb01d09b2ef5e49dc0be2e6006f962fd87f1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wasm-micro-runtime/wasm-micro-runtime/compare/main...1f98fb01d09b2ef5e49dc0be2e6006f962fd87f1.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"ffc22889948b1f063d7258d34d4e636ee0914925","node_id":"C_kwDOCwGZ2toAKGZmYzIyODg5OTQ4YjFmMDYzZDcyNThkMzRkNGU2MzZlZTA5MTQ5MjU","commit":{"author":{"name":"liang.he","email":"liang.he@intel.com","date":"2026-11-06T05:39:09Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-11-06T05:39:09Z"},"message":"feat(ba-issues): add runs, honor -i, drop dedup (#5201)\n\nOne wasm with several exports needed a config entry per export, and\nthe same id could only run once. Add an item-level `runs` list, one\nentry per iwasm invocation with its own options, argument and expected\nreturn. Shared compile runs once per (item, id).\n\n-i/--issues now filters build and run, not only the summary. Duplicate\nids across items all run; the old dedup silently skipped them.","tree":{"sha":"7c210ea36cb06cc62f097c3b68bad7faf98ef107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wasm-micro-runtime/wasm-micro-runtime/git/trees/7c210ea36cb06cc62f097c3b68bad7faf98ef107"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wasm-micro-runtime/wasm-micro-runtime/git/commits/ffc22889948b1f063d7258d34d4e636ee0914925","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq7Wf9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADbEQAKi3mIY07NKTNlcVYY5jiFfr\nUuMDIgRhw+SQteAVu/rVN83HsVyBXZ2i81tRSKyP/BCMA5H